Portfolio search v2 — high frequency — 2026-08-03

Retargeted at the sqrt(N) optimum: weekly Sharpe rises with the square root of
trade count, and with a fixed cost c the gross edge maximising it is exactly
2c (~$2.84 on MNQ, ~700 trades/week for $1,000/week).

Changes: 30-min signal spacing instead of 2h, EV floor below the optimum
instead of on top of it, short holds admitted, ranking on weekly Sharpe and
frequency instead of dollars per trade. Assembler fills the trade budget and
requires trade-through fills.
